+"""Real-world side-effect connectors (SMS, and later email/calendar/voice).
+
+Kept separate from agents/orchestrator: agents decide *what* to send, the
+orchestrator decides *whether* to send it now, and this package is the only
+place that actually talks to an outside provider over the network.
+"""
